WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.335
Out front with me now is James Clapper,

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.770
former director of national intelligence

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.738
under President Obama,

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:05.772
also retired lieutenant

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:06.373
general in the U.S.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.140
Air Force,

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.641
and Ian Bremmer, president

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.143
and founder of the Eurasia Group.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.011
Gentlemen, it's good to see you

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.012
this evening.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.213
Director Biden

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:15.015
saying tonight that Ukraine doesn't

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:18.518
need F-16s right now, but Zelinski,

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.121
even today was calling again on the West

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.956
to provide them.

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.090
Who's right?

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:27.060
Well, I think

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.462
actually the lengthy is, to be honest,

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.031
I think the administration

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.599
is losing an opportunity here

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.167
to exert leverage

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.769
by simply announcing

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:37.404
that we're going to enter

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:39.272
Ukrainian pilots into training

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.241
and their maintainers

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:42.876
to support the maintenance

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.277
requirements in F-16

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:45.578
and then reserve judgment on

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:48.214
when and where to deploy them later.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:49.082
The problem is

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.350
is these weapons systems

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.451
get more complex.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.720
They require more lead time to train.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.721
The Ukrainians

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.990
set up the supply and logistics.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.925
So I think would be

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.360
it would be to show support

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.995
for the Ukrainians

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:04.164
and convey a message to the Russians.

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:05.398
If we simply announce

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:06.466
that we're going to

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:08.101
start a training program

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.370
for the Ukrainians, on the F-16,

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.271
because ultimately

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.239
maybe they don't need it today,

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.241
but they're going to at some point

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:17.010
because that's,

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:17.410
you know, air

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.712
defense is a requirement

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:20.513
for the Ukrainians

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.614
and the 16

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.850
as a capable air to ground attacker.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.286
So I would respectfully suggest

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.254
the administration consider

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.522
announcing that

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:30.824
and then reserve judgment

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:32.692
on the actual deployment for later.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:33.993
Is an interesting point

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.728
director that even the announcement

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:36.996
even though as we've seen with

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:37.831
all of the other

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.333
announcements and then

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.001
how the actual delivery comes

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:44.070
months months later for some of these

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:45.872
more complex systems

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:46.773
the announcement itself

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.540
can work as a deterrent

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.908
and send a strong message.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:49.876
And just

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:51.444
broadly, as we're sitting here

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:53.646
on 365 days into this

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:54.447
where do you see this

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.549
four standing one you're in?

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.018
Well, for the last year,

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.186
the level of support

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:01.154
that the United States

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:02.288
and the allies have provided to

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.157
the Ukrainians has been extraordinary.

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:05.859
It's been
staggering really well beyond

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:07.060
what anyone would have expected,

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.761
including the Ukrainians

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.263
in the early days,

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.698
as well as the coordination

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:13.600
in punishing the Russians.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.069
The big question is, can that persist?

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.271
Certainly you are starting

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.507
to see a reduction of support

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.142
among some Republicans

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:22.842
and certainly

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:24.310
among public opinion

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.713
of those that tend to vote Republican

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:28.181
as well. As among independents.

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:28.748
And the Europeans

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:30.016
are watching that carefully.

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:31.351
They're deeply concerned about it.

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:32.218
When I was in

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:33.720
Munich at the security conference

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.220
last week

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.256
speaking to a lot of Ukrainian officials.

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:38.158
You know,
they don't like this formulation

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.392
of the Americans saying

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.094
as long as it takes

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:42.795
because they feel like

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:44.931
time is not working in their favor.

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.466
They need as much as possible.

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:48.001
As soon as possible,

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:48.635
because if they're still

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:49.636
fighting in two or three,

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:51.671
four years time on their ground,

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:52.272
their economy

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:53.439
is going to be completely destroyed.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:54.741
They're concerned about that.

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:55.742
The final point

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:57.544
is that China, of course, is now

00:02:57.544 --> 00:02:59.145
playing a greater role.

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:00.880
And the fact that they put forward

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.982
this 12 point diplomacy plan

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:04.784
is not going to be accepted

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.319
by the Ukrainians or the Americans,

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.787
but it is going to be accepted

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:09.255
by all the developing countries

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:09.622
in the world.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:09.956
In fact,

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:11.157
if you didn't know that China had written

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:11.891
this plan

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:13.593
could have easily come from India

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.528
or from Brazil or South Africa.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.530
That's a problem for the United States.

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:19.299
It's a problem going forward

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:21.534
in terms of how this conflict plays out.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:22.435
It's interesting.

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:23.169
You know, Director,

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:24.037
speaking of China,

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:26.172
from an intelligence perspective,

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:27.040
what do you think of this

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.575
new reporting that that U.S.

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:29.576
Intel suggests

00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:31.010
that China is considering

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:34.080
sending drones and ammunition to Russia,

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:36.616
having American intelligence, even it put

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.351
this out there. Does what?

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:42.021
Well, I think it helps to

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:45.458
it's a good use of intelligence to exert

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:48.494
some pressure on the Chinese,

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.496
hopefully leaning on them

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:54.400
not not to do this, not to provide

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:57.003
weapons to

00:03:58.204 --> 00:03:59.772
the Ukrainians,

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:00.907
not whether they will or not.

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.208
That remains to be seen.

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:03.243
But I,

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.477
I think this continues

00:04:04.477 --> 00:04:06.913
a pattern of operationalizing

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:09.215
the use of intelligence, either

00:04:09.215 --> 00:04:10.984
to pursue a military objective

00:04:10.984 --> 00:04:12.885
or in this case, a diplomatic one

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.887
by dining out the Chinese in advance.

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:16.356
And hopefully putting some pressure

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:17.790
on not to provide

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.627
weaponry of any sort to the Ukrainians,

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:25.231
even when it comes

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:27.267
if China isn't deterred,

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.768
if they do decide to go ahead

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:32.105
and provide the drones and ammunition.

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:33.840
What do you think the United States

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:34.907
and its allies

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:38.211
should do if China crosses a line here?

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:39.879
Do you think the U.S.

00:04:39.879 --> 00:04:41.447
should be drawing a red line on it?

00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:44.784
I think one of the interesting things

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.019
over the course of this war

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:46.919
is that the Chinese,

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:48.354
for all of their support

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:50.390
of Russia diplomatically,

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.891
they they really have been

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:52.725
on the sidelines.

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:53.059
In fact,

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:54.661
actual Chinese policy towards

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:56.763
Russia has been virtually identical

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:57.797
to that of India,

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.399
which is, of course, much more aligned

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:00.566
with the United States.

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:03.870
If they were to provide direct military

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:07.173
support for Russia, that is a red line.

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.274
And that's why it's so important

00:05:08.274 --> 00:05:09.742
that not just the Americans,

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:11.878
but also the UK prime minister,

00:05:11.878 --> 00:05:13.246
the NATO's secretary general.

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:14.514
They all coordinated

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:16.382
in making these very strong statements

00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:17.550
over the last few days

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.985
that there will be hell to pay

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:20.420
if the Chinese actually decide

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.554
they're going to put their thumb

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:22.855
on the scale in that way

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:23.923
in favor of the Russians.

00:05:23.923 --> 00:05:26.159
I think you would see direct sanctions,

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:27.293
secondary sanctions

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:28.494
from the United States

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:30.196
against Chinese firms.

00:05:30.196 --> 00:05:31.531
And while the Europeans

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:33.733
would have to debate this very strongly

00:05:33.733 --> 00:05:35.401
because you know, their economies

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:36.736
are already getting hit a lot harder

00:05:36.736 --> 00:05:38.271
because of this Russia war,

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:39.872
I suspect that most of them,

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:41.774
especially the Germans and the French,

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:43.776
would be aligned with the United States.

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:45.778
This is the exact opposite of what

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.213
the Chinese wants to see happen

00:05:47.213 --> 00:05:47.747
going forward.

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:48.781
So I agree with Jim

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:49.415
was a good use

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:50.817
for operational intelligence.

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:52.985
And I personally would be quite surprised

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.187
if the Chinese went ahead

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:55.488
and actually did

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:57.256
provide these weapons in the near future.

